cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Glycomass calculations, spectra, or identifier results in research,
  please cite this software and include the version or commit used. For the
  hosted service, also record the access date.
type: software
title: Glycomass
authors:
  - family-names: Bärenfänger
    given-names: Melissa
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2855-924X
  - family-names: Till
    given-names: Christian
repository-code: https://github.com/christiantill/Glycomass
abstract: >-
  Theoretical mass and isotope spectrum calculators for glycans, glycopeptides,
  and glycoproteins, with an MGF glycopeptide identifier.
keywords:
  - mass spectrometry
  - glycans
  - glycopeptides
  - glycoproteins
